    <h1>About NovaShop Gallery</h1>
    <p>NovaShop Gallery started as a small print shop with a simple idea: art for the home shouldn't be complicated to find, order, or hang. Today we work with independent photographers and artists around the world to bring their work into everyday spaces — living rooms, hallways, studios, and offices.</p>
    <p>Every piece we sell is produced in small batches using archival-grade materials, and our framing partners hand-finish each order before it ships. We believe good design should be accessible, not exclusive, and we're proud to ship thousands of prints every month to customers who feel the same way.</p>
    <p>Our small team handles everything from sourcing to quality control, so when a print arrives at your door, you can trust it's been checked twice.</p>
</div>
